cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kierston or KierstonBench, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Kierston & KierstonBench"
abstract: >-
  Kierston is a deterministic simulation of a mid-sized American city and the
  records its residents leave behind. KierstonBench evaluates language-model
  agents on investigation tasks over those records.
